\f0\fs24 \cf0 This README describes the formatting of the data in the manuscript: \'93Disinhibition of a recurrent attractor gates a persistent goal signal for navigation\'94 by Lanz et al.. The README is split into two sections: 1) two photon calcium imaging data and 2) electrophysiology data\
